WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
An old record can be perfectly organized, and still fail to prove its explanation.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
That is the lesson of Puységur's animal magnetism files.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
When a meditation seller describes frequencies, studies, and a promise of better focus, ask three separate questions.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Is the phenomenon real? Was this method studied? And did anyone test this exact recording?

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
A free twelve-minute baseline can tell you what you want to measure, but not whether a product caused an improvement.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Follow the sources first. Decide what is worth paying for second.
